{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Swidux ships a companion agent skill (","type":"text"},{"code":"swidux-ref","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":") for AI coding assistants like Claude Code. It contains the architecture rules, conventions, and code templates an assistant needs to generate correct Swidux code without you re-explaining the patterns.","type":"text"}]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The skill is published in "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/github.com\/heirloomlogic\/skills"},{"type":"text","text":" — Heirloom Logic’s public skills repo — alongside any future Heirloom skills. Two files:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"SKILL.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — architecture rules (the 10 rules, the dispatch lifecycle, plugin shapes, anti-patterns).","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"swidux-patterns.md","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" — copy-pasteable code templates for ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppState","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppAction","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", reducers, ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppStore","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" factory, views, plugin wiring, and Swift Testing reducer tests.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Installing the skill","level":2,"anchor":"Installing-the-skill","type":"heading"},{"text":"GitHub CLI (recommended)","level":3,"anchor":"GitHub-CLI-recommended","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Requires "},{"code":"gh","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" ≥ v2.90.0 ("},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/cli.github.com"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["gh skill install heirlo